WEBVTT

00:01:46.566 --> 00:01:50.966
I have received information that Nene's
Flying Fortress Galleon is headed for Korin!

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:52.700
What?!

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.500
Three minutes until the drop point.

00:01:59.966 --> 00:02:02.626
Zola, stamp your feet in vexation.

00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:04.966
Blue Explosion!

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:14.126
The second engine room has been hit!

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:16.233
Drop the ruins!

00:02:16.533 --> 00:02:18.233
Releasing the object! Dropping!

00:02:24.533 --> 00:02:25.903
What happened, maro?!

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.966
Nene discarded the ruins!

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:34.930
Exactly! And now this mass of rock
will fall on Korin like a bomb.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.400
Hippo!

00:02:40.433 --> 00:02:42.703
Boss Lady! Now!

00:02:42.733 --> 00:02:45.933
We can do it!

00:02:59.633 --> 00:03:02.133
Blue Explosion!

00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:08.826
- We did it!
- We did it! We did it! We did it!

00:03:13.766 --> 00:03:18.666
WHISPER WHISPER BOOM!

00:03:37.066 --> 00:03:38.596
Shu! Everyone!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.200
Conrad!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.700
Save the pleasantries.
Please explain the situation.

00:03:45.266 --> 00:03:47.196
No, that can wait, too.

00:03:47.233 --> 00:03:47.903
What?

00:03:48.466 --> 00:03:51.796
We want to get inside that fortress.
Please help us out.

00:03:52.733 --> 00:03:53.733
Understood.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.970
Please follow me, everyone.

00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:07.666
Flying Dragons, huh?

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.370
Now we can get to the fortress!

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.230
Unfortunately, it's not going to be
one dragon per person...

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.500
Your kindness is appreciated.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.970
Good luck, Zola.

00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:22.033
I leave the enemies
on the ground to you.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.300
Lord Conrad, we should get going...

00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:25.666
I know.

00:04:25.933 --> 00:04:30.403
As a Knight Master, I swear to protect
this city of Korin, no matter what!

00:04:34.566 --> 00:04:35.226
Shu...

00:04:35.733 --> 00:04:37.033
Come back safe.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.300
You too, Conrad!

00:04:44.866 --> 00:04:47.566
Zola! Do you seriously intend
on attacking it right now?

00:04:47.866 --> 00:04:48.966
Yeah, I do.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.100
But you still haven't...

00:04:50.266 --> 00:04:55.466
There's no need to worry about me.
Killer Bat has already gained power.

00:04:57.133 --> 00:05:01.433
And one more thing.
There's something I must tell all of you.

00:05:01.966 --> 00:05:04.426
It's about the seventh
Soldier of Light.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.400
The identity of the seventh
Soldier of Light...

00:05:13.866 --> 00:05:14.866
is Nene.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.400
That can't be!

00:05:16.433 --> 00:05:18.233
- Nene?!
- Maro...

00:05:18.266 --> 00:05:20.266
How can a descendant of
the Soldiers of Light

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.170
do such terrible things?!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.630
Yeah. Soldiers of Light are supposed
to be heroes who saved this world.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.370
The Great War of Light and Darkness
is a historical fact of the past.

00:05:29.666 --> 00:05:33.426
You guys should all know
through your own experience

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:35.726
that we are different
from our ancestors.

00:05:38.633 --> 00:05:43.003
You guys are now completely different
from when you first fought Nene.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.200
History is already advancing
to a new stage.

00:05:48.533 --> 00:05:52.333
Now is the time to put
an end to Nene's atrocities!

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.670
- Right!
- Right!

00:05:57.033 --> 00:05:58.373
Alright! Let's go!

00:05:58.733 --> 00:05:59.733
Yeah!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.870
So, what is Logi saying?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.100
Saying? Saying?

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.400
Nothing new, sir.

00:06:10.866 --> 00:06:13.226
It seems he is earnestly making
all necessary arrangements.

00:06:14.066 --> 00:06:15.426
That Logi...

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.500
Oh, well. What's the battle situation?

00:06:18.866 --> 00:06:21.326
Black Shadow Type Two
units one through four

00:06:21.366 --> 00:06:23.766
are engaging the enemy forces
on the ground.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.800
We've breached 24% of
the enemy lines at this point.

00:06:27.566 --> 00:06:28.626
What about Zola's group?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.830
It's unclear, sir!

00:06:30.066 --> 00:06:31.396
No, wait!

00:06:32.933 --> 00:06:35.333
There is something
approaching from Korin!

00:06:35.566 --> 00:06:36.666
What did you say?

00:06:37.066 --> 00:06:39.196
I'll bring it up on the monitor.
Maximum magnification.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:46.500
Zola!

00:06:51.466 --> 00:06:52.526
Say, Hippo.

00:06:52.933 --> 00:06:54.473
What is it, Boss Lady?

00:06:54.866 --> 00:06:57.896
Did we really get stronger?

00:06:58.466 --> 00:07:00.226
Of course!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.800
So what's our new power?

00:07:02.733 --> 00:07:03.833
No idea.

00:07:04.766 --> 00:07:08.226
Everyone, ascend!
We'll go around to the top of the fortress!

00:07:08.633 --> 00:07:09.733
Roger!

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.270
Bring them down!
Bring them down no matter what it takes!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.370
Don't let them get
any closer to the Galleon!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.600
We made it!

00:07:35.633 --> 00:07:37.303
Just as I thought.

00:07:37.866 --> 00:07:41.496
It seems the fortress wasn't designed
to anticipate attacks from above.

00:07:41.766 --> 00:07:43.526
Alright! Let's go!

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:44.570
Shu!

00:07:44.966 --> 00:07:46.066
Follow Shu!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.500
Where's the entrance?

00:07:52.533 --> 00:07:53.803
We don't need one!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.070
Huh?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.830
Blue Dragon!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.200
This is a bit much, maro.

00:08:06.233 --> 00:08:07.633
Great, Shu!

00:08:07.733 --> 00:08:08.833
Okay, let's go!

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.530
The enemy has infiltrated the Galleon!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.470
They're moving into the S Field!

00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:18.396
Szabo, you take care of them.

00:08:18.433 --> 00:08:19.733
Take care, take care!

00:08:19.766 --> 00:08:21.596
Yes, sir... But...

00:08:21.733 --> 00:08:25.633
There was something interesting in
the S Field if I remember correctly.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.400
Interesting! Interesting!

00:08:27.766 --> 00:08:29.466
Something interesting?

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.100
Oh! I get it!

00:08:32.433 --> 00:08:33.873
Roger.

00:08:38.233 --> 00:08:39.233
Where are we?

00:08:40.066 --> 00:08:41.096
A dead end?!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:52.970
A trap, huh?!

00:08:53.066 --> 00:08:55.896
I'll take them on no matter who they are!

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:06.170
Modified Black Shadow Type Three...

00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:07.873
Activate!

00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:18.273
Too many Black Shadow
Type Threes, maro!

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.470
Let's get these things!

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.130
Minotaur!

00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:23.403
Me too, maro!

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:28.803
Come on, you jerk!

00:09:29.433 --> 00:09:31.403
Go, Minotaur!

00:09:31.433 --> 00:09:33.933
Leave it to me! Time to go wild!

00:09:52.966 --> 00:09:53.966
How about that?!

00:09:54.066 --> 00:09:55.626
Nothing to it!

00:09:55.933 --> 00:09:58.173
That was surprisingly easy, maro!

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:03.426
Don't think these are the same
Black Shadows as before...

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.130
W-What's this?!

00:10:21.733 --> 00:10:22.733
No way...

00:10:22.766 --> 00:10:25.126
Why?! We destroyed them already!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.530
What the hell?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.730
Are you shocked, Jiro?!

00:10:29.866 --> 00:10:31.996
That voice... Szabo?!

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.500
You'll pay for what you
did to me the other day!

00:10:34.766 --> 00:10:37.396
And you'll pay in full!

00:10:37.433 --> 00:10:42.103
We don't have the time to fight you!
We've come to defeat Nene!

00:10:42.233 --> 00:10:43.333
Where is he?!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:49.100
Save it until you've defeated these
Modified Black Shadow Type Threes!

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.000
It'll be the same no matter
how many times you try!

00:11:11.866 --> 00:11:12.526
W-What's this?

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:13.470
You fool!

00:11:13.733 --> 00:11:18.573
The Modified Black Shadow Type Three
is totally, completely, and utterly invincible!

00:11:37.233 --> 00:11:38.503
This is endless...

00:11:39.233 --> 00:11:40.933
Leave this to me!

00:11:41.433 --> 00:11:42.503
Bouquet?!

00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:45.896
This is our chance to
rise to the challenge!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.130
What?! Really?!

00:11:48.166 --> 00:11:52.566
Yes! It's time for us to shine and
help out everyone in trouble.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.800
H-H-H-How do we do that?!

00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:55.833
I don't know!

00:11:57.033 --> 00:12:01.173
But we've gotten our new power,
so it'll work out somehow!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.700
No, I don't think so...

00:12:04.733 --> 00:12:06.173
Yeah...

00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:07.933
Just do it!

00:12:09.966 --> 00:12:11.126
Understood!

00:12:11.333 --> 00:12:13.973
But whatever happens,
don't blame me!

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:17.503
Our power is starting to build up.
At least I think it is!

00:12:17.833 --> 00:12:19.603
Go, Hippo!

00:12:34.666 --> 00:12:36.726
I might be pretty cool
if I do say so myself!

00:12:45.866 --> 00:12:46.526
Bouquet!

00:12:47.233 --> 00:12:48.233
I knew it...

00:12:48.533 --> 00:12:50.903
- Ouch!
- Boss Lady!

00:12:51.133 --> 00:12:52.503
Are you okay?

00:12:52.533 --> 00:12:55.173
I hit my butt. Owww...

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.270
Huh? There's something...

00:12:58.300 --> 00:12:59.930
Stand back, little girl!

00:13:00.566 --> 00:13:02.226
Leave this to us!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.070
I'll fight as long as it takes!

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:08.100
I'll smash them to pieces so they
won't be able to regenerate, maro.

00:13:08.166 --> 00:13:11.326
Forget it! It's not that easy.

00:13:11.766 --> 00:13:12.996
Then what're we
supposed to do, maro?!

00:13:13.166 --> 00:13:15.496
He's saying they're invincible,

00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:18.373
but do you really think there are things
in this world that are invincible?

00:13:18.766 --> 00:13:20.666
You mean there's a trick to this?

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:21.966
Perhaps.

00:13:22.166 --> 00:13:23.566
What kind of trick?!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.200
You little!

00:13:33.066 --> 00:13:33.726
That sound...

00:13:34.166 --> 00:13:34.826
What's that?!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.170
What about it?

00:13:40.466 --> 00:13:41.666
Did you notice?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:46.870
There's always a sound like something's
being dispersed before they regenerate.

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.800
Really?

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.270
So what does that mean?!

00:13:52.466 --> 00:13:53.596
Nanomachines...

00:13:53.866 --> 00:13:55.066
Nanomachines?!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:00.470
Nanomachines are machines
so small they can't be seen.

00:14:02.733 --> 00:14:06.373
Most likely, they are being
dispersed in this space

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.370
and are assisting with
the extraordinary regeneration.

00:14:09.833 --> 00:14:12.303
So that's how they
keep coming back?

00:14:12.566 --> 00:14:14.226
I see. So that means...

00:14:14.733 --> 00:14:16.733
First, we have to destroy the walls

00:14:16.766 --> 00:14:18.166
and the equipment generating
the Nanomachines.

00:14:18.666 --> 00:14:19.926
It'd be worth trying!

00:14:20.333 --> 00:14:21.333
Roger!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.000
Alright, let's go!

00:14:24.466 --> 00:14:25.696
You're in the way!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.000
Get out of my way!

00:14:32.566 --> 00:14:35.626
Maybe we haven't
changed a bit after all...

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.730
Umm, Boss Lady...

00:14:37.766 --> 00:14:38.426
What is it?

00:14:38.733 --> 00:14:40.533
I have something good to tell you...

00:14:41.933 --> 00:14:43.373
Crushing Nail!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.370
Ray Stinger!

00:14:55.266 --> 00:14:56.896
Eternal Breath!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.030
Waves of Rage!

00:15:12.433 --> 00:15:14.503
Blitz Claw!

00:15:23.166 --> 00:15:24.466
How about that?!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:35.770
What?!

00:15:36.066 --> 00:15:36.726
What's this?

00:15:38.533 --> 00:15:40.803
I commend you for
figuring out the trick behind

00:15:40.833 --> 00:15:42.633
the Modified Black Shadow
Type Three.

00:15:43.233 --> 00:15:47.833
However, the Nanomachines are robots
so small they can't be seen.

00:15:47.966 --> 00:15:50.226
They can get into any cracks.

00:15:50.266 --> 00:15:53.526
The Nanomachines can't be stopped
just by destroying the equipment.

00:15:53.566 --> 00:15:56.026
It makes no difference at all.

00:15:58.666 --> 00:15:59.666
Damn that Szabo...

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:04.330
Then it seems our only choice is to
attack Szabo who's controlling the T3s...

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:08.330
But how?!
We don't even know where he is.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.930
Leave it to me!

00:16:11.266 --> 00:16:13.966
This is our chance to
rise to the challenge!

00:16:14.533 --> 00:16:15.733
Hey, Bouquet...

00:16:15.766 --> 00:16:17.166
You haven't learned your lesson yet?

00:16:17.333 --> 00:16:18.573
It's not like that.

00:16:18.666 --> 00:16:20.896
I'm saying this because I'm
the only one who can do it.

00:16:21.533 --> 00:16:22.533
Bouquet...

00:16:22.566 --> 00:16:24.896
Please, Zola. Let me do this.

00:16:26.666 --> 00:16:27.666
Okay.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.300
Then I'm going with her...

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.200
No, you guys keep
Szabo distracted here.

00:16:33.466 --> 00:16:36.126
Okay. I leave this to you, Bouquet.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:36.970
Right!

00:16:39.566 --> 00:16:41.766
Will she be okay, maro?

00:16:41.966 --> 00:16:46.026
Hey, Modified T3s!
Stop sitting around and attack!

00:16:48.433 --> 00:16:52.073
We will destroy them all here!
Got it?!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.330
- Right!
- Right!

00:17:14.066 --> 00:17:16.326
Boss Lady! Will you be okay?

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:20.230
I'll be fine. I've got you with me.

00:17:21.733 --> 00:17:23.603
You're gonna make me cry...

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.300
Alright, let's do this!

00:17:25.566 --> 00:17:28.226
I'm going to test out our new power.

00:17:29.466 --> 00:17:30.126
Oh...

00:17:30.166 --> 00:17:31.266
I'm bored.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:32.930
Enemies won't come this far.

00:17:33.033 --> 00:17:33.703
Boss Lady!

00:17:34.066 --> 00:17:34.726
Right!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.670
Is it okay to be goofing off like that?

00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:39.796
It's an intruder!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.300
Hold it!

00:17:42.266 --> 00:17:43.266
Oh!

00:17:43.566 --> 00:17:45.126
- L-Lord Nene!
- L-Lord Nene!

00:17:47.366 --> 00:17:48.696
Where's Szabo?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.970
I will verify immediately, sir!

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:57.030
If I might be so impertinent, sir,
we came down here in pursuit of an intruder.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.730
Did you happen to see her?

00:17:58.866 --> 00:18:02.596
She had huge breasts
and didn't look so bright...

00:18:02.633 --> 00:18:04.073
What did you say?!

00:18:04.466 --> 00:18:05.126
Huh?

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:06.370
Oh...

00:18:06.566 --> 00:18:09.096
Nothing, never mind. Ahem...

00:18:09.733 --> 00:18:11.533
Now, where is Szabo?

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.130
It appears that he's
commanding an operation

00:18:15.166 --> 00:18:17.766
in the control room of
the S Field, section three.

00:18:18.133 --> 00:18:23.333
S Field... That's a rather nice spot.
But show me the way anyway.

00:18:23.466 --> 00:18:24.126
Yes, sir.

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:25.330
And...

00:18:26.933 --> 00:18:29.573
You're fired!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.970
What?!
No way!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.730
I'm getting tired, maro...

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.300
Bouquet hasn't done it yet?

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:03.900
It's futile. It's only a matter of time
before they use up all of their strength.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.100
Lord Szabo!

00:19:06.866 --> 00:19:09.396
Don't bother me.
I'm busy right now...

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.530
I have brought Lord Nene!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.530
Lord Nene!

00:19:14.166 --> 00:19:17.526
A-As you can see,
they are hanging on by a thread.

00:19:17.666 --> 00:19:20.026
We've almost won!

00:19:20.166 --> 00:19:22.896
What?! Really?! That's bad!

00:19:22.933 --> 00:19:23.603
Huh?

00:19:24.266 --> 00:19:28.126
Oh nothing, ahem... Never mind...

00:19:28.166 --> 00:19:30.966
Good work. You can leave now.

00:19:31.166 --> 00:19:31.826
Yes, sir!

00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:39.373
Lord Nene, did you come here
to finish them off yourself?

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.400
No.

00:19:40.633 --> 00:19:43.873
Then you came to witness
their end close up?

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.500
That's not it, either.

00:19:45.633 --> 00:19:47.073
Then, why did you come?

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.600
Actually...

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.170
Actually?

00:19:54.733 --> 00:19:56.203
I came to defeat you!

00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:01.273
Oh! You! How?!
Why?! What?!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.300
Hippo!

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:04.700
Boss Lady!

00:20:04.733 --> 00:20:07.303
Hipopon, Hipotama,
Transform!

00:20:07.533 --> 00:20:10.073
Turn into the Modified
Black Shadow Type Three!

00:20:12.866 --> 00:20:14.126
What?!

00:20:14.233 --> 00:20:15.773
Let's go, Hippo!

00:20:16.133 --> 00:20:16.803
Right!

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.000
You're bluffing!

00:20:20.066 --> 00:20:20.726
Huh?

00:20:21.266 --> 00:20:23.796
If I remember correctly,
you have the power to transform,

00:20:23.833 --> 00:20:26.373
but no battle skills whatsoever!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.770
There's no way you can defeat me!

00:20:31.066 --> 00:20:32.326
I don't know about that.

00:20:32.833 --> 00:20:33.833
What?!

00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:38.366
Have you forgotten that we've
also gotten our new power?

00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:39.503
Huh?!

00:20:39.766 --> 00:20:44.466
Hippo told me earlier
about our new ability!

00:20:45.166 --> 00:20:47.866
The ability to copy!

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:49.800
Ability to copy?

00:20:49.833 --> 00:20:53.473
Remember the attack
we got hit with earlier?

00:20:53.566 --> 00:20:56.626
Up until now,
we could only imitate form,

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:01.900
but now we can copy attacks we are
hit with and use them ourselves.

00:21:02.233 --> 00:21:03.473
It can't be...

00:21:03.533 --> 00:21:05.203
Oh yes, it can!

00:21:05.466 --> 00:21:06.766
Here we go!

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.370
Fire T3 Beam!

00:21:09.533 --> 00:21:11.033
Go!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.800
No way!

00:21:15.833 --> 00:21:18.373
Hot!

00:21:21.066 --> 00:21:24.496
This could really be
the end of me this time!

00:21:27.566 --> 00:21:28.226
Did we do it?

00:21:28.566 --> 00:21:29.926
We might have...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:33.470
- We did it, Hippo!
- We did it!

00:21:34.566 --> 00:21:35.896
This is the switch?

00:21:43.566 --> 00:21:44.226
What's happening?

00:21:44.533 --> 00:21:45.203
Maro...

00:21:45.666 --> 00:21:47.996
I know! Bouquet came through!

00:21:48.233 --> 00:21:50.603
Yoo-hoo! Can you hear me, guys?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.200
Loud and clear!

00:21:52.433 --> 00:21:54.103
Good work, Bouquet.

00:21:54.466 --> 00:21:55.826
That's cool, but...

00:21:56.966 --> 00:22:00.466
I don't know where we are,
so come get us!

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:03.670
This way. Hurry!

00:22:04.233 --> 00:22:05.233
It seems this is the place.

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:08.400
Shu!

00:22:09.466 --> 00:22:11.696
Kluke, can you find out
where Nene is?

00:22:12.166 --> 00:22:12.826
I'll give it a try!

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:22.470
He's here!

00:22:22.966 --> 00:22:24.066
Alright, let's go!

00:22:34.666 --> 00:22:35.666
So you've come, eh?

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:18.200
Nene, who has been
researching on Shadow,

00:24:18.233 --> 00:24:20.233
activates an army of Chimeras.

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:22.000
Fool... Listen up.

00:24:22.233 --> 00:24:24.403
The Chimera with its shadow showing
on the ground is the real one.

00:24:24.433 --> 00:24:26.303
Huh? But none of them
has a shadow...

00:24:26.333 --> 00:24:28.273
Well, the Chimeras themselves
are Shadows, so...

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:29.800
Huh? Wait, Zola!

00:24:29.833 --> 00:24:30.833
Let's go.

00:24:30.866 --> 00:24:31.866
R-Right...

00:24:31.966 --> 00:24:34.696
Next on Blue Dragon:
Aerial Fortress Showdown
